<title>UK: London bourse income down, to return 10 mln stg. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>London bourse income down, to return 10 mln stg. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects income change in headline from &quot;up&quot; to &quot;down&quot;.)</p>
<p>The London Stock Exchange said on Thursday its income in the year to March 31, 1997 was 191.8 million stg against 196.1 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The bourse said it was returning 10 million stg as a rebate to its member firms.</p>
